		{"id":"maintenance","type":"text","text":"## 维护与自动化\n\n- [候选队列流程](_Inbox/README.md) · [积压检查脚本](scripts/inbox_status.py)\n- `_System/` 是本地运行日志，已加入 `.gitignore`，不入库\n- 每周运行 `python scripts/inbox_status.py`，保持 `pending <= 10`\n- 新增文档后同步：目录 README → [INDEX](INDEX.md) → [Home](Home.md) → 本画布","x":1460,"y":1210,"width":740,"height":380}
